  "prefLabel": "He-P 2703.10 Critical Items",
  "priorExpiration": "2008-12-28",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 2703.10 Critical Items. On the milk plant inspection report contained in the Pasteurized Milk Ordinance incorporated by reference in Mil 301.01, the following shall be considered critical items:\n\n(a) Item 7a - d: water supply;\n\n(b) Item 12a or c: cleaning and sanitizing of containers/equipment;\n\n(c) Item 15b: cross connections;\n\n(d) Item 16a,2, 16b,2, or 16c,2: time and temperature controls;\n\n(e) Item 16b,3 or 16c,3: adulteration controls;\n\n(f) Item 16c: regenerative heating; and\n\n(g) Item 17(a, b, or d): cooling of milk.\n\nSource. #7315, eff 7-1-00; ss by #9189, INTERIM, eff 7-1-08, EXPIRES: 12-28-08; ss by #9325, eff 11-21-08; ss by #12101, eff 2-3-17; ss by #13175, eff 3-2-21",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-p2700.html"
}
